'''NEO Best of the Best''' (極選抜祭レアガチャ, ''Goku Senbatsusai Gacha'', '''Extreme Selection Festival Gacha''') is a [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] event introduced in [[Version 8.7 Update|version 8.7]]. There are multiple iterations of this set, each featuring different units. This page shows the most recent version of this gacha.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
}}

